{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45113","headline":"同李侍御萼李判官集陆处士羽新宅 · 皎然","name":"同李侍御萼李判官集陆处士羽新宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素风千户敌，新语陆生能。\n借宅心常远，移篱力更弘。\n钓丝初种竹，衣带近裁藤。\n戎佐推兄弟，诗流得友朋。\n柳阴容过客，花径许招僧。\n不爲墙东隐，人家到未曾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}